{"id":"1e43e920742fc3f2","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-resurrecting.md","title":"Resurrecting","display":"df-resurrecting — Resurrecting","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-resurrecting","aliases":["58-df-resurrecting"],"display":"df-resurrecting — Resurrecting","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-resurrecting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-resurrecting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resurrecting — Resurrecting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md\">../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md\">../batch09/58-df-elementary.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,W,\\mathbb P,R,\\mathbb Q,S,\\kappa,G,H,\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\in V\">\\(M,N,W,\\mathbb P,R,\\mathbb Q,S,\\kappa,G,H,\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md\">../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak H_\\kappa(N)\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak H_\\kappa(N)\\in V\\)</span>（以内部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\kappa^N\">\\(H_\\kappa^N\\)</span> 为论域、以真实成员关系为解释的集合编码结构；元层构造）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md\">../batch09/58-df-elementary.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Res}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Res}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义；参数含成员语言码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resurrecting}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}&amp;\\mathrm{Res}_S(\\mathbb P,R,\\kappa,M,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathbb P,R,\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,R,M)\\to\\exists N,W,\\mathbb Q,S,H\\in V\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb P,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathbb Q,S\\in N\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,S)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(H,\\mathbb Q,S,N)\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(W,N,\\mathbb Q,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak H_\\kappa(M),\\mathfrak H_\\kappa(W),\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resurrecting}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}&amp;\\mathrm{Res}_S(\\mathbb P,R,\\kappa,M,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathbb P,R,\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,R,M)\\to\\exists N,W,\\mathbb Q,S,H\\in V\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb P,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathbb Q,S\\in N\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,S)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(H,\\mathbb Q,S,N)\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(W,N,\\mathbb Q,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak H_\\kappa(M),\\mathfrak H_\\kappa(W),\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The predicate says that after forcing with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span>, further forcing can restore the first-order theory of the designated hereditary-size segment by an elementary inclusion.</li>\n<li>It is a property relative to the ground model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> and cutoff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; a resurrection axiom additionally quantifies over a specified class of forcing notions.</li>\n<li>两个扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=M[G]\">\\(N=M[G]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=N[H]\">\\(W=N[H]\\)</span> 现在由上游四元扩张谓词显式见证；不再把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G][H]\">\\(M[G][H]\\)</span> 当作未绑定项。内部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\kappa\">\\(H_\\kappa\\)</span> 的结构编码明确标为元层构造。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c4